{
"#name"
:
{
"bfind"
:
null
,
"cn"
:
"为 AI agent 设计的 BFS 宽范围文件搜索"
,
"en"
:
"BFS broad file search designed for AI agents"
}
,
"#synopsis"
:
[
{
"x bfind [--bfs-mindepth N] [--bfs-maxdepth N] [--all] [--next] [-i NAME]... [--no-ignore] [--no-homeignore] [--prune-hidden] [--verbose|-v] [--] [path] [find-expr]"
:
null
}
,
{
"x bfind ."
:
null
}
,
{
"x bfind --next --bfs-maxdepth 5 ."
:
null
}
,
{
"x bfind -i vendor -- . -type f"
:
null
}
]
,
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"与 x find 共享 ignore 规则的广度优先搜索，浅层优先，适合逐步深入探索"
,
"en"
:
"Breadth-first search sharing ignore rules with x find, shallow results first, ideal for incremental exploration"
}
,
"-i|--ignore"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"添加自定义忽略目录名（可叠加使用）"
,
"en"
:
"Add custom ignore directory name (can be stacked)"
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"忽略的目录名"
,
"en"
:
"Directory name to ignore"
}
}
}
,
"--no-ignore"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"禁用默认忽略规则"
,
"en"
:
"Disable default ignore rules"
}
}
,
"--no-homeignore"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"禁用 $HOME 目录下的额外忽略规则"
,
"en"
:
"Disable extra ignore rules for $HOME directory"
}
}
,
"--prune-hidden"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"排除隐藏目录（. 开头），默认不排除隐藏目录"
,
"en"
:
"Prune hidden directories (dot-prefixed), off by default"
}
}
,
"--verbose|-v"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"显示当前生效的忽略列表"
,
"en"
:
"Show active ignore lists"
}
}
,
"--all"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"显示所有结果（深度最大，自动关闭 --next）"
,
"en"
:
"Show all results (max depth, auto-disables --next)"
}
}
,
"--bfs-mindepth"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"设置 BFS 起始深度（默认1）"
,
"en"
:
"Set BFS starting depth (default 1)"
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"深度值"
,
"en"
:
"Depth value"
}
}
}
,
"--bfs-maxdepth"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"设置 BFS 最大深度（默认3）"
,
"en"
:
"Set BFS maximum depth (default 3)"
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"深度值"
,
"en"
:
"Depth value"
}
}
}
,
"--next"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"在 maxdepth 边界探测下一层可展开条目数，输出到 stderr"
,
"en"
:
"Probe expandable entry count at maxdepth boundary, output to stderr"
}
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"en"
:
"Since v0.9.8: dropped per-layer iteration and streaming in favor of a single find with prune + awk depth sorting. Default depth reduced to 3 for agent use — agents don't need streaming, and limited context benefits from small depth + --next to explore incrementally.\n"
,
"cn"
:
"v0.9.8 起：因效率考虑和 agent 适用性，放弃逐层搜索和流式输出，改用单次 find + prune + awk 结果重整。默认深度降至 3，配合 --next 下层统计信息，逐步深入探索。\n"
}
,
{
"en"
:
"Shares the same ignore module as `x find`. Default excludes (-name): .git, .svn, .hg, node_modules, __pycache__, .venv, .gradle, .mvn, .build, .cache, .tmp, .DS_Store\n"
,
"cn"
:
"与 `x find` 共享同一套 ignore 模块。默认排除（-name）: .git, .svn, .hg, node_modules, __pycache__, .venv, .gradle, .mvn, .build, .cache, .tmp, .DS_Store\n"
}
,
{
"en"
:
"Default depth is 3. Use --bfs-maxdepth to go deeper, or --bfs-mindepth with --bfs-maxdepth to explore a specific layer range.\n"
,
"cn"
:
"默认搜索 3 层。用 --bfs-maxdepth 加深，或配合 --bfs-mindepth 搜索指定层范围。\n"
}
,
{
"en"
:
"--next probes one extra layer and prints next-level (expandable dirs) and next-level-count (total child entries) to stderr. Useful for deciding whether to continue exploring.\n"
,
"cn"
:
"--next 多遍一层，在 stderr 输出 next-level（可展开目录数）和 next-level-count（子条目总数）。用于判断是否继续深入。\n"
}
,
{
"en"
:
"Common -i values: vendor, target, dist, build, out, venv, Pods, DerivedData\n"
,
"cn"
:
"常用 -i 值: vendor, target, dist, build, out, venv, Pods, DerivedData\n"
}
,
{
"en"
:
"For git projects, prefer git ls-files and git grep for indexed search. For depth-first search with full find compatibility, use `x find`.\n"
,
"cn"
:
"在 git 项目中，优先使用 git ls-files 和 git grep 进行索引搜索。如需深度优先搜索且完整兼容 find 参数，使用 `x find`。\n"
}
]
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x bfind ."
,
"cn"
:
"BFS 搜索当前目录（默认3层）"
,
"en"
:
"BFS search current directory (default 3 layers)"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x bfind --next ."
,
"cn"
:
"搜索并显示下一层可展开条目数（stderr）"
,
"en"
:
"Search and show next-level expandable count (stderr)"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x bfind --all --bfs-maxdepth 5 ."
,
"cn"
:
"深度5层，显示全部结果"
,
"en"
:
"Depth 5 levels, show all results"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x bfind --bfs-mindepth 2 --bfs-maxdepth 4 ."
,
"cn"
:
"只搜索第2到第4层"
,
"en"
:
"Search only layers 2 to 4"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x bfind --ignore vendor --ignore target -- . -name \"*.go\""
,
"cn"
:
"Go 项目排除 vendor 和 target，查找 .go 文件"
,
"en"
:
"Go project, exclude vendor and target, find .go files"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x bfind --no-ignore --ignore node_modules ."
,
"cn"
:
"清空默认排除，只忽略 node_modules"
,
"en"
:
"Clear defaults, only ignore node_modules"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x bfind --no-ignore --no-homeignore ~"
,
"cn"
:
"禁用所有忽略规则，等同原生 find（BFS 模式）"
,
"en"
:
"Disable all ignore rules, same as raw find (BFS mode)"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x bfind --prune-hidden ."
,
"cn"
:
"排除所有隐藏目录"
,
"en"
:
"Prune all hidden directories"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x bfind --verbose ."
,
"cn"
:
"显示当前生效的忽略列表"
,
"en"
:
"Show active ignore lists"
}
]
}

